# Accepted Trivy misconfiguration findings for the rendered chart.
# Every entry needs a reason; review when Trivy or the chart changes.

# KSV-0011 CPU limit: intentionally unset. CPU limits cause CFS throttling of
# SMTP/HTTP handling; a CPU request is set and users can add a limit via `resources`.
AVD-KSV-0011

# KSV-0125 untrusted registry: docker.io/axllent/mailpit is the official upstream
# image. Mirror it and override `image.registry` if your policy requires it.
AVD-KSV-0125

# KSV-0110 default namespace: artifact of rendering without a namespace; all
# resources are installed into the Helm release namespace.
AVD-KSV-0110
